WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.683 --> 00:00:03.266
(bright music)

00:00:05.056 --> 00:00:08.151
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.151 --> 00:00:08.984
- I know that there's gonna be some

00:00:08.984 --> 00:00:10.975
crazy baby products of the future.

00:00:10.975 --> 00:00:13.398
I know there's gonna be
a stroller with Wi-Fi.

00:00:13.398 --> 00:00:16.460
(light music)

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.861
I just love babies, they're just great.

00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:20.505
They're so nice to hold.

00:00:20.505 --> 00:00:21.338
You don't know what you're holding,

00:00:21.338 --> 00:00:22.171
you could be holding like the

00:00:22.171 --> 00:00:23.794
next President of the United States.

00:00:23.794 --> 00:00:28.351
- I have two boys, they're
the best humans on the planet.

00:00:28.351 --> 00:00:30.552
With my second son, they actually told me

00:00:30.552 --> 00:00:33.473
he was a girl and that's
kind of all I've ever wanted,

00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:35.521
I mean don't get me wrong, I love my boys

00:00:35.521 --> 00:00:37.773
but there's just something about
a mother having a daughter.

00:00:37.773 --> 00:00:40.056
- I do feel like this
emotional clock ticking

00:00:40.056 --> 00:00:42.703
where I need this like
little bundle of joy

00:00:42.703 --> 00:00:44.794
to remind me that there's good in life,

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:45.833
and maybe I should just get a dog.

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:50.438
Me and my girlfriend have
talked very briefly about kids.

00:00:50.438 --> 00:00:51.896
I think it would freak her out to know

00:00:51.896 --> 00:00:53.678
how much I actually love kids.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:56.899
(upbeat music)

00:00:56.899 --> 00:00:58.067
- Is that a baby? (laughs)

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:00.077
- [Man] And like...
(baby cries)

00:01:00.077 --> 00:01:01.494
- Oh, it's a kid.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:05.358
(screams)

00:01:05.358 --> 00:01:06.510
- [Woman With Baby] Hi.
- [Woman On Couch] What!

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:08.087
- [Woman With Baby] This is Jaya.

00:01:08.087 --> 00:01:09.662
- Hi!

00:01:09.662 --> 00:01:11.187
Oh, she's so cute!

00:01:11.187 --> 00:01:12.020
(baby coos)

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:13.312
- Hi! How you doing?

00:01:13.312 --> 00:01:14.678
- Yeah, you can hold her.
(baby noises)

00:01:14.678 --> 00:01:16.219
- What are you doing here?

00:01:16.219 --> 00:01:17.861
Oh my god, I'm like shaking!

00:01:17.861 --> 00:01:19.448
(baby coos)

00:01:19.448 --> 00:01:22.897
Hi. (sobs) Oh my god, I'm sorry.

00:01:22.897 --> 00:01:25.064
(sobbing)

00:01:26.488 --> 00:01:27.970
I'm sorry! (crying)

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:29.869
- [Woman] It's pretty cool.
- [Baby] A baby.

00:01:29.869 --> 00:01:31.363
- Did she just a say a baby? (laughs)

00:01:31.363 --> 00:01:33.361
- Yeah, that wasn't her first word was it?

00:01:33.361 --> 00:01:35.202
- That's the first word I've ever

00:01:35.202 --> 00:01:38.291
been able to make out, how weird. (laughs)

00:01:38.291 --> 00:01:39.309
- (whispering) If I had ovaries,

00:01:39.309 --> 00:01:41.563
they'd be exploding right now.
- Oh my god.

00:01:41.563 --> 00:01:43.867
Please don't let my
girlfriend see this. (laughs)

00:01:43.867 --> 00:01:46.109
- And my son's one and a half
(baby yells)

00:01:46.109 --> 00:01:48.509
and I've already forgotten this stage

00:01:48.509 --> 00:01:51.221
of his life, I think that's
why I started crying.

00:01:51.221 --> 00:01:54.893
- (gibberish) Oh, we've
got another one. (laughs)

00:01:54.893 --> 00:01:56.821
What is going on? (laughing)

00:01:56.821 --> 00:01:58.052
- [Woman with Baby] Hi.
- Hey!

00:01:58.052 --> 00:02:00.229
- This is Cody.
- Hi Cody!

00:02:00.229 --> 00:02:02.075
- (laughing)

00:02:02.075 --> 00:02:05.200
- Did somebody peer into
my dreams? Oh my gosh.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.208
- You're gonna do awesome
things, I can tell.

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:09.312
(baby making noises) Uh huh.

00:02:09.312 --> 00:02:11.807
What actual video is this? (laughing)

00:02:11.807 --> 00:02:13.767
- Thank you guys so much

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:14.651
- Bye!
(baby makes noise)

00:02:14.651 --> 00:02:15.609
(laughing)

00:02:15.609 --> 00:02:17.419
- (whispering) Bye.
(baby noises)

00:02:17.419 --> 00:02:18.488
(upbeat music)

00:02:18.488 --> 00:02:20.352
- Jaya was so cute.

00:02:20.352 --> 00:02:22.446
I don't know I was just like,
oh that could be my baby!

00:02:22.446 --> 00:02:24.234
She just had these beautiful brown eyes.

00:02:24.234 --> 00:02:28.248
- (sobbing) It's crazy
how, how fast they grow up

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:31.125
and how you don't even remember it.

00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:34.123
(crying) I'm like so happy
but like shocked to death.

00:02:34.123 --> 00:02:37.011
I want a daughter, or a
boy, I don't even care.

00:02:37.011 --> 00:02:39.608
I just want another baby, I love babies.

00:02:39.608 --> 00:02:42.034
Hey
- [Man On Phone] Hi, sweetie.

00:02:42.034 --> 00:02:44.367
Do you want to have a daughter?

00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:45.200
- [Man On Phone] Do I
wanna have a daughter?

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.033
- Yeah.

00:02:47.392 --> 00:02:48.609
- [Man On Phone] Well, yes. Of course!

00:02:48.609 --> 00:02:49.688
(laughing and sobbing)

00:02:49.688 --> 00:02:51.011
- Okay, I really want kids.

00:02:51.011 --> 00:02:52.605
I only experience them
for like five minutes,

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.565
but I think that's enough time to know

00:02:54.565 --> 00:02:56.688
that I want to make a life
long commitment. (laughs)

00:02:56.688 --> 00:03:00.338
- Parenthood is the most
heartbreaking, time of your life,

00:03:00.338 --> 00:03:02.880
because you're so proud and happy,

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:06.587
and so crushingly
devastated at the same time

00:03:06.587 --> 00:03:07.893
that your kids are growing up.

00:03:07.893 --> 00:03:10.643
(acoustic music)

00:03:13.235 --> 00:03:15.801
- So much strength, they're so strong!

